        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY GAME FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoners War: Rush is an idle tower defense RPG where you build a team of Monsters to battle. Feast your eyes on fascinating Monster artwork and stunning skill effects, and take on stages and Defense mode bosses with your ever-evolving Monster lineup! Log in now and claim 14 essential top-tier Monsters and all the materials you need to start growing them—for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/63a9fc6856a2ed4faca49303dbf6d35d.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb through stages and face off against increasingly strong bosses. The higher the difficulty, the better the rewards. Exploit each boss's weakness to clear stages faster and reach new heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/6adc3f7311ca0e1c545158d42d01dc5d.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sky Island Defense (Tower Defense Mode)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Sky Island Defense, a unique tower defense mode. Strategically place your Monsters and unleash skill cards to wipe out waves of incoming enemies. Coordinate support skills to take down powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss limited-time campaign events tied to new Monster releases—packed with valuable rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/e5931c8483ea48f087a896d40813be38.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magic Orb</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Magic Orbs to instantly acquire equipment. If a newly obtained piece is stronger than what's equipped, it will auto-replace to boost your power. Equipment is collected even during battle, making your progression both dynamic and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/15a33e5a9ca18c77ff393393b70f7909.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skill card usage and Monster placement to the test in Challenge Mode! Face 25 intense waves on massive tower defense maps—twice the size of Sky Island Defense. Make real-time card choices, compete on the leaderboard, and aim for top ranks in new weekly seasons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/8e764c94be3ccd50ae37ea4fe21470d9.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Land of Conquest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop aboard your airship and conquer zones across the Land of Conquest. Defeat bosses and capture regions to earn loot—including powerful boss Critters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/f6750683cfee0b66e971843f2b6acec7.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guild Dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with your Guild to defeat powerful dungeon bosses. Form a 50-Monster army—25 from your team and 25 from your Guildmates. Work together, rack up points, and fight for the #1 spot in the Guild rankings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/a90bf30d230ec9022c122dd7ff2c458b.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Critters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Critters that boost your team’s overall stats just by owning them. Each Critter enhances a specific attribute, and their power increases with upgrades and level-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/2eb2d2d9798dfa74f4cde3dc33e3afa3.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your Monsters to unlock their full potential. Awaken them to gain unique, powerful skills. Use your upgraded team to push back waves of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/2acc3f4e8dc6cdd64ac6c926ca27a036.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY GAME FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoners War: Rush is an idle tower defense RPG where you build a team of Monsters to battle. Feast your eyes on fascinating Monster artwork and stunning skill effects, and take on stages and Defense mode bosses with your ever-evolving Monster lineup! Log in now and claim 14 essential top-tier Monsters and all the materials you need to start growing them—for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/63a9fc6856a2ed4faca49303dbf6d35d.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb through stages and face off against increasingly strong bosses. The higher the difficulty, the better the rewards. Exploit each boss's weakness to clear stages faster and reach new heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/6adc3f7311ca0e1c545158d42d01dc5d.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sky Island Defense (Tower Defense Mode)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Sky Island Defense, a unique tower defense mode. Strategically place your Monsters and unleash skill cards to wipe out waves of incoming enemies. Coordinate support skills to take down powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss limited-time campaign events tied to new Monster releases—packed with valuable rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/e5931c8483ea48f087a896d40813be38.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magic Orb</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Magic Orbs to instantly acquire equipment. If a newly obtained piece is stronger than what's equipped, it will auto-replace to boost your power. Equipment is collected even during battle, making your progression both dynamic and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/15a33e5a9ca18c77ff393393b70f7909.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skill card usage and Monster placement to the test in Challenge Mode! Face 25 intense waves on massive tower defense maps—twice the size of Sky Island Defense. Make real-time card choices, compete on the leaderboard, and aim for top ranks in new weekly seasons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/8e764c94be3ccd50ae37ea4fe21470d9.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Land of Conquest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop aboard your airship and conquer zones across the Land of Conquest. Defeat bosses and capture regions to earn loot—including powerful boss Critters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/f6750683cfee0b66e971843f2b6acec7.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guild Dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with your Guild to defeat powerful dungeon bosses. Form a 50-Monster army—25 from your team and 25 from your Guildmates. Work together, rack up points, and fight for the #1 spot in the Guild rankings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/a90bf30d230ec9022c122dd7ff2c458b.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Critters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Critters that boost your team’s overall stats just by owning them. Each Critter enhances a specific attribute, and their power increases with upgrades and level-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/2eb2d2d9798dfa74f4cde3dc33e3afa3.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your Monsters to unlock their full potential. Awaken them to gain unique, powerful skills. Use your upgraded team to push back waves of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813590/extras/2acc3f4e8dc6cdd64ac6c926ca27a036.avif?t=1776742064\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>",
